    {
      "source": "Note that <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>SmartInitializingSingletons</code></a> are\nautomatically excluded from lazy initialization to ensure that their\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>callback method</code></a> is\ninvoked.",
      "translation": "请注意，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>SmartInitializingSingletons</code></a> 会自动从延迟初始化中排除，以确保其<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>回调方法</code></a>被调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Beans that are in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html#ROLE_INFRASTRUCTURE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>infrastructure role</code></a>\nare automatically excluded from lazy initialization, too.",
      "translation": "处于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html#ROLE_INFRASTRUCTURE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>infrastructure role</code></a>中的 Bean 也会被自动排除在懒加载初始化之外。",
      "count": 2
    },
